              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-outfit font-bold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-2">Legalitas Aman (SHM & PBG)</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Legalitas terjamin aman dibandingkan pilihan perumahan di Batang lainnya. Sertifikat Hak Milik (SHM) dan PBG/IMB sudah siap balik nama atas nama Anda.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- USP 2: Bebas Banjir -->
        <div class="bg-neutral-50 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-neutral-200/50 border border-neutral-100 p-6 rounded-2xl transition duration-300 group">
