              Rumah Subsidi
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl shadow font-outfit font-black text-brand-emerald-950 text-sm">
              Mulai Rp 166 Juta-an
