          </div>
          
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h3 class="font-outfit font-extrabold text-2xl text-neutral-950">Tipe 32 / 66 (Subsidi)</h3>
              <p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
